        "sid": "HEB 4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onyo, Were otieko weyo riwan cikirok nike wanyalo donjo i ywomirok pere. Am'omiyo, wagwokere win, aka moro kwoŋ win wokiri wokeŋ donjo i ywomirok no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole wabende watieko winjo Wac Manyen Maber, paka jo; to wac ma jowinjo k'otimo rijo bero moro, rupiri munyo jowinjo jok'ojolo gi yeyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.95.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 95:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Am'omiyo wan ma wayeyo, wadonjo i ywomirok no paka Were owaco ni,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meno a gima go owaco, kada tic pere oyido orumo wok cuka go cwey piny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.2.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cak 2:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Me a gim'owacere kamoro i Ndiko Maleŋ kwoŋ ndelo mar'abirio: “Were oywomere i ndelo mar'abirio kwoŋ tic pere je.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.95.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 95:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka kenyo odoko owac'iye ni, “Jokibino donjo i piny ma d'amiy'iye jo ywomirok!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joma jopen winjo wac pa Were jok'onyalo nwaŋo ywomirok no; rupiri jok'oyeyo am'omiyo nitie joman m'oyey jo limo kaywomirok me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.95.7+PSA.95.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 95:7-8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka Were odoko oketho ndelo man m'ilwoŋo ni, konon, ma cango oluwo kwoŋe rumacen gi i dhok Daudi, i wac m'otiek nyutho ni, “Ka wiwinjo dwondi Were konon, wikiri wicay go.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.31.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cik 31:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.22.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yos 22:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rupiri bedi Yosuwa tieki miyo ji ywomirok, di Were k'oluwo kendo kwoŋ ndelo man. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To paka nitie, fodi odoŋ ri ji pa Were ywomirok ma Sabato. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.2.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cak 2:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole dhano je ma donjo i ywomirok pa Were bende won ywomere kwoŋ tic pere paka Were cango oywomere kwoŋ tic pere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Am'omiyo, weyi watem paka wanyalo donjo i ywomirok no. Kiripi moro kwoŋ wan cayo dwondi Were paka jotimo, to wakeŋ donjo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole wac pa Were kwo aka tiyo. Bith loyo abor ma nyalewe ario. Thumo kiri kama paro kodi cuny jorom'iye, gi kama kumbo kodi more joriwer'iye. Niaŋ kwoŋ awanya kodi paro pa ji ma iy'adundo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ongoye gima nyalo panere ri Were. Gimoro je i cwec othangere aka oyare i waŋe, go ma wabino tito kwo mawan ruwaŋe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu Jacway ri Were i wi migam Madwoŋ",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Weyi wacwire matek kwoŋ yeyo ma watuco ni wan gine, paka kere wanitie gi jadwoŋ mapa jocway ri Were i wi migam, m'oasere gi dwoŋ m'obedo Yesu Wod Were won, m'otieko kidho i polo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jadwoŋ pa jocway ri Were i wi migam, mawan me, k'obedo ŋata kiniaŋ nyapo mawan. Kucel, wanitie gi jadwoŋ pa jocway ri Were i wi migam ma bende olimo karatem i royo je paka walimo, to k'otimo gimarac. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Am'omiyo, weyi wabedi miseni, aka wakidhi ro nyim kom pa Were ma dhum, kama nema nitie i iye. Kenyo wabino lim'iye wor to wanwaŋo ŋono manyalo konyo wan i hongo ma wayeny'iye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
